{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>觀塘道發生爆水管事故，今日（2日）下午港鐵觀塘站對開至裕民坊一帶均現水浸，大量黃泥水湧出。從網上圖片可見，黃泥水淹沒行車線；有網民笑言：「邊個倒瀉奶茶？」</p><figure><img alt=\"港鐵觀塘站外有輕微水浸。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149358779037782016931248.jpeg/zsJnrVYr0_7OYsGTRmvtaDiFf6TozzevcHArvnBwK74\"/><figcaption>港鐵觀塘站外有輕微水浸。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"港鐵觀塘站外有輕微水浸。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149358776479125504438605.jpeg/3MDhZNJbUdbXfJvUCSqxdcYvumMUCM2GrEZGbKxGRmw\"/><figcaption>港鐵觀塘站外有輕微水浸。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"港鐵觀塘站外有輕微水浸。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149358774008549376590812.jpeg/jDfTs9WKw2auQwNK7gUhXWUMpnj-xYVWJBnlsCQZ5bA\"/><figcaption>港鐵觀塘站外有輕微水浸。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃泥水淹沒行車線。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149358771026268160762093.jpeg/mOplGqpGsNAGDLiqXJ_x1HRb7sAWH8pYxBB24cQQduE\"/><figcaption>黃泥水淹沒行車線。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"裕民坊對開的水流比較大。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149358993437626368139546.png/X4ks1sIYbYts8R-0FqO1BwBTfTrWZLV4NVFgjDVRYIw\"/><figcaption>裕民坊對開的水流比較大。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"裕民坊對開的水流比較大。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149358995773984768214356.png/MW6V0Ye_LPJOIoitsBISHPXncvg-ex4EGmyYixpsmIs\"/><figcaption>裕民坊對開的水流比較大。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"裕民坊較早前已封閉。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149358998194229248873602.jpeg/t9qaG4u3gOkpXP7ktFrsRSMwVvsIPCWnznmMo855jKM\"/><figcaption>裕民坊較早前已封閉。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-02T06:39:01.978068+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}